    },
    {
      "t": "group",
      "class": "container",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "t": "p",
          "html": "The dot marker next to each item shows its status and always has a text label: \"Verified and handed over\" for published work, \"Idea\" for an empty slot."
        },
        {
          "t": "raw",
          "html": "<article class=\"work-item work-item-featured work-item-media\"> <div class=\"work-item-text\"> <span class=\"dot-tag\"><span class=\"dot-ring dot-d3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Verified and handed over</span> <h2><a href=\"https://ghazalalidoost.art\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ghazalalidoost.art</a></h2> <p class=\"work-label\">Client work · Ghazal Alidoust's portfolio website</p> <p class=\"work-label\">Our role: Design and build</p> <a class=\"service-link\" href=\"https://ghazalalidoost.art\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Visit ghazalalidoost.art (opens a new tab)</a> </div> <figure class=\"work-item-shot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/img/ghazal-home-dark-en.webp\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"/img/ghazal-home-dark-en.jpg\" alt=\"Ghazal Alidoust's website home page — dark mode, English\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1280\" height=\"800\"></picture></figure> </article>",
          "class": "work-item work-item-featured",
          "tag": "article"
        },
        {
          "t": "raw",
          "html": "<article class=\"work-item work-placeholder\"> <span class=\"dot-tag\"><span class=\"dot-ring dot-d0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Idea</span> <h2>More work</h2> <p class=\"work-label\">To be added here.</p> </article>",
          "class": "work-item work-placeholder",
          "tag": "article"
        },
        {
          "t": "p",
          "html": "Some work, such as penetration tests and internal documentation, is confidential by default. We publish it only in redacted form and with the owner's written permission."
        }
